FAQs:

Q: Why use React/Next.js instead of WordPress?
A: React-based sites load up to 10x faster, have zero security vulnerability plugins, and can integrate complex B2B API features easily.

Q: Can we edit content ourselves after launch?
A: Yes - we integrate a headless CMS (Sanity or Strapi) with an editor panel, so your team can update text and images without touching code.

Q: Do you handle domain, DNS, and SSL setup?
A: Yes, we secure your brand domain, configure DNS records, and enable SSL/HTTPS as part of the build, so the site launches on a locked-down, properly configured foundation.

Q: What's the typical project timeline?
